# DISPLAY WIRING

| PIN ON DEVICE | CONNECTION | ESP32-S3 GPIO PIN | NOTES |
| :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **T_IRQ** | LEAVE DISCONNECTED | — | Touchscreen Interrupt |
| **T_DO** | LEAVE DISCONNECTED | — | Touchscreen MISO |
| **T_DIN** | LEAVE DISCONNECTED | — | Touchscreen MOSI |
| **T_CS** | LEAVE DISCONNECTED | — | Touchscreen Chip Select |
| **T_CLK** | LEAVE DISCONNECTED | — | Touchscreen Clock |
| **SDO (MISO)** | CONNECTED | **GPIO 13** | Hardware FSPI MISO |
| **LED** | 3.3V RAIL | — | Screen Backlight (Max Brightness) |
| **SCK** | CONNECTED | **GPIO 12** | Hardware FSPI Clock |
| **SDI (MOSI)** | CONNECTED | **GPIO 11** | Hardware FSPI MOSI |
| **DC** | CONNECTED | **GPIO 9** | Data / Command Selection |
| **RESET** | CONNECTED | **GPIO 8** | Screen Hardware Reset |
| **CS** | CONNECTED | **GPIO 10** | Hardware FSPI Chip Select |
| **GND** | GND | — | Common Ground |
| **VCC** | 3.3V RAIL | — | Main Display Power |
